{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9357.616750000001,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9698.134947,"text":"În 1990, a fost adăugat pe lista Patrimoniului Mondial în Pericol din cauza amenințării nisipurilor deșertului."},{"kind":"audio","t":9878.901676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9880.300453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9881.62245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9883.216332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9884.847404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9886.607909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9887.119200000001,"samples":15436,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":18870.009568999998,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19274.186657,"text":"Dacă ați urmărit filmul National Treasure, s-ar putea să credeți că o hartă a comorii a fost scrisă pe spatele Declarației de Independență."},{"kind":"audio","t":19425.024088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19426.487577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19428.130849999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19429.743941999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19431.390754999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19433.010726999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":19433.227381999997,"samples":2619,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26838.381516999998,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27169.638069999997,"text":"Copiii sunt plasaţi în asistenţă maternală pentru o mare varietate de motive care variază de la neglijenţă la abuz."},{"kind":"audio","t":27299.414999999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27300.731635999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27302.382239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27304.022682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27305.819497999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27305.953981,"samples":5294,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":29880.821097999997,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":29979.492648,"text":"Și chiar la extorcare."},{"kind":"audio","t":30012.18626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":30012.341113,"samples":390,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40797.382575,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41219.44997,"text":"Valea Chocamo, prima destinație de alpinism din Chile, cunoscută sub numele de Yosemite din America de Sud, cu o varietate de pereți mari de granit și stânci."},{"kind":"audio","t":41397.538185000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41398.883002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41400.497734000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":41402.123256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41403.760379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41405.404642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41407.071945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41407.80329,"samples":17219,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":46505.834878,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46780.147733000005,"text":"Au fost acceptate punctele de vedere ale lui Aristotel cu privire la toate aspectele științei, inclusiv fiziologia."},{"kind":"audio","t":46913.587867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46915.154468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":46916.734410000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46918.376442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46920.031765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46920.537065000004,"samples":13653,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":54273.428909,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54572.150052000005,"text":"Dacă nu sunteți obișnuiți să conduceți pe drumuri de țară, păstrați-vă mintea despre voi. Predomină pante abrupte, benzi înguste și curbe strânse."},{"kind":"audio","t":54694.702088000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54695.984073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54697.594865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54699.260329000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":54699.364341,"samples":167,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":54700.8379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":54702.515764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54704.080955000005,"samples":31709,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":67489.354354,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":67961.358885,"text":"Prezența adevăratei echipe invizibile, Larson și LaFasto, 1989, pagina 109, este, de asemenea, o componentă unică a unei echipe virtuale."},{"kind":"audio","t":68168.52066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68169.94118899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68171.625522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68173.340467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68175.01736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68176.688403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":68178.39399699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68180.09548199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68181.158033,"samples":22068,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":73026.185695,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73309.57421199999,"text":"După ce accidentul a avut loc, Gibson a fost transportat la un spital, dar a murit la scurt timp după aceea."},{"kind":"audio","t":73437.026776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73438.410854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73439.992015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73441.626578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73443.24882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73443.525066,"samples":9752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":82777.48323299999,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83046.834619,"text":"Multe produse de patiserie germane conțin migdale, alune de pădure și alte nuci. Prăjiturile populare se potrivesc adesea deosebit de bine cu o ceașcă de cafea tare."},{"kind":"audio","t":83181.700061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83183.207151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83184.824964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83186.41509499999,"samples":32656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":83188.09145899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83189.92416499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83191.375974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83192.953616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83193.124959,"samples":7968,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":90150.62906899999,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90509.350329,"text":"Este de la sine înțeles că, dacă cunoașteți o limbă romanică, vă va fi mai ușor să învățați portugheza."},{"kind":"audio","t":90625.59919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":90626.95094699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90628.56016899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90630.218582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90630.777783,"samples":14934,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":97832.379192,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98088.679628,"text":"Spectacolul de sunet și lumină al piramidei este unul dintre cele mai interesante lucruri din zonă pentru copii."},{"kind":"audio","t":98217.01520899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98218.42012699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98220.020359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98221.65124199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98223.275384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98223.446728,"samples":7523,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":103723.035249,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":103988.59426,"text":"Fluxul de trafic este studiul mișcării șoferilor individuali și a vehiculelor între două puncte."},{"kind":"audio","t":104102.154257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104103.54966399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104105.249128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104106.771639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104107.601155,"samples":20229,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":106590.1964,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106762.58124099999,"text":"Și interacțiunile pe care le fac unii cu alții."},{"kind":"audio","t":106817.916485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106819.119389,"samples":29647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":114622.361223,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":114878.07400699999,"text":"Australianul Mitchell Gowrie a terminat pe locul 11 în clasamentul general al Super G-ului masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":115011.638033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115013.057772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":115014.613333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115016.23310499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115017.86684799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115018.639423,"samples":18111,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":121615.218958,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":121861.161238,"text":"Ulrich Joklin s-a clasat pe locul 16 în Super G-ul masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":121951.77705599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121953.193355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121954.772476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121955.45805,"samples":16495,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":128634.22046499999,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":128973.689111,"text":"După cum s-a menționat, studiile independente sugerează că batalionul nepalez de menținere a păcii al ONU a adus"},{"kind":"audio","t":129099.23163699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":129100.458032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129102.337359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129103.771088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129105.38061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129105.50519299999,"samples":2507,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":136532.063425,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136851.38942,"text":"La scurt timp după izbucnirea ostilităților, Marea Britanie a inițiat o blocadă navală a Germaniei."},{"kind":"audio","t":136970.609209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136971.99850699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136973.583269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136975.233472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136976.66997,"samples":29981,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":145645.677604,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":145923.894807,"text":"De asemenea, a atacat tot ce a intrat în apă. Chiar și un dinozaur uriaș, cum ar fi T-Rex nu ar fi nici un meci pentru ea."},{"kind":"audio","t":145998.709331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146000.17554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146000.318113,"samples":4959,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"audio","t":146025.749561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146027.348752,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146029.013596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146029.200559,"samples":8136,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":155039.79530599999,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155268.678775,"text":"Utilizarea înregistrării video a dus la descoperiri importante în interpretarea microexpresiilor."},{"kind":"audio","t":155373.41946499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155374.796023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155376.391905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155378.030507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155378.16499,"samples":6575,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":159396.241315,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159550.043335,"text":"Mișcări faciale care durează câteva milisecunde."},{"kind":"audio","t":159616.366959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159617.944071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159618.584383,"samples":15826,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":167454.191382,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167747.1732,"text":"Anunţul a fost făcut după ce Trump a avut o conversaţie telefonică cu preşedintele turc Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":167872.742347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167874.16722499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167875.791438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167877.40831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167879.039042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167879.142864,"samples":3900,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":174917.654182,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175237.69986999998,"text":"Acestea sunt plaje de familie uneori aglomerate, cu o gamă bună de magazine aliniate pe țărm."},{"kind":"audio","t":175350.697056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175352.348849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175353.942341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175355.526532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175356.34818899998,"samples":19114,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":177085.42127299999,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177193.937619,"text":"Vreau doar să fiu în siguranţă."},{"kind":"audio","t":177237.527379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177237.888287,"samples":15157,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":188436.40667199998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188796.774336,"text":"Cele mai multe dintre insulele mai mici sunt națiuni independente sau asociate cu Franța și cunoscute ca stațiuni de plajă de lux."},{"kind":"audio","t":188946.43605299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188947.980694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188949.592946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188951.492164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188952.876262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188954.464303,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"close","t":199704.739146,"code":1005}]}